#. Diagram label
msgid "Post-MVP theme and UI review"
msgstr ""

#: skills/workflows/theme-ui-review.bpmn:55
#. Diagram label
msgid "Raise findings against the authoring"
msgstr ""

#: skills/workflows/theme-ui-review.bpmn:59
#. Diagram label
msgid "Reviewed"
msgstr ""

#: skills/workflows/theme-ui-review.bpmn:15
#. Diagram label
msgid "Reviewer"
msgstr ""

#: skills/workflows/theme-ui-review.bpmn:13
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reviewing what the MVP actually RENDERS — accessibility, branding, languages — once stakeholders have accepted it. Post-MVP by design: choosing a theme is an authoring judgement made per note, and there is no role-to-theme mapping to check at build time. What can be reviewed is the result, and only after there is one."
msgstr ""

#: skills/workflows/theme-ui-review.bpmn:33
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Which themes are in use, on which surfaces, in which locales — read off the artefacts rather than the intent. A theme declared and never chosen is not in the review; a surface nobody listed is the one that ships wrong."
msgstr ""

